<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Delham takes 6.8 pct stake in Coles.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Delham takes 6.8 pct stake in Coles.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian investment group Delham Investments Pte Ltd, which has a 20 percent stake in Brierley Investments Ltd, said on Friday it had taken a 6.8 percent interest in retailer Coles Myer Ltd last week.</p>
<p>Brierley itself also has a 6.8 percent stake in Coles Myer through its Australian subsidiary, Australian Consolidated Investments Ltd (ACIL).</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
